{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-azizi-plaza","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"azizi-plaza-jebel-ali","about":"Plaza is a modern 15-storey building in Dubai, in the Meydan One quarter, on Nad Al Sheba Street 1, which combines the best of French Mediterranean design and modern architecture, creating the perfect place for modern community living.Plaza offers studios and apartments with 1, 2 and 3 bedrooms for purchase. Each apartment has panoramic windows and seamless balconies.Children's and adult pools, recreation areas with barbecue facilities, sports and playgrounds, yoga studios, a gym, a zen meditation garden, a lounge with a night cinema, a pet walking area are available for all residents of the complex. Commercial premises are open on the ground floor of the building: shops, restaurants, coffee shops. The tower has parking and 24-hour security.The convenient location of the facility ensures the convenience of traveling by private transport, while public transport is also available. A 17—minute drive from AZIZI Riviera there is a comprehensive school and a kindergarten - Canadian Kids Nursery, 30 minutes away there is a Russian International School. Carrefour Hypermarket or Fruit Market can be reached in 15-20 minutes by car. Meydan One Mall is a 15-minute walk away.","price":2500000,"title":"Azizi Plaza","bitrix":{"id":571,"pf_id":"are.2.8888","source":null,"project_id":"Azizi Plaza","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Azizi Projects","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Azizi Developments","project_location":"Al Furjan"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/40/images/2023/6/6/340x252/F3iPrdkn4HOVNpr2lNcDNAse1c4NCQs1KwkWzQcw.webp","464x312":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/40/images/2023/6/6/464x312/F3iPrdkn4HOVNpr2lNcDNAse1c4NCQs1KwkWzQcw.webp"}],"status":"ready","_geoloc":{"lat":25.0219575,"lng":55.1367474}